  "$description": "The single source of truth for HireEvo's visual language. The brand ramp is derived in OKLCH from the navies the design file names \u2014 #054a91 (Primary/blue-500), #043567 (Primary/blue-700) and #376ea7 (Primary/blue-400) \u2014 so lightness steps are perceptually even while all three sit in it exactly and are never approximated. The warning ramp is derived the same way around the file's Tartiary/orange-700, #ab5200. The neutral ramp is the cool grey the design pairs with them. Semantic tokens reference primitives by path and are the only names application code may use.",
